RAW SELECT:
SELECT o.metric || '|' || o.value_text || '|' || o.source || '|' || a.role_key || '|' || r.command FROM outcomes o JOIN attempts a ON a.id = o.attempt_id JOIN runs r ON r.id = o.run_id AND r.id = a.run_id WHERE o.metric IN ('scope_decision','review_verdict','portfolio_verdict','obstruction_class') ORDER BY o.metric, o.id;
obstruction_class|NONE|verdict|pm|tick
portfolio_verdict|ON_TRACK|verdict|cpo|portfolio-review
review_verdict|GO_WITH_CHANGES|verdict|pm|tick
scope_decision|ASSIGN|verdict|pm|tick
scope_decision|UNPARSED|verdict|pm|tick
scope_decision|COMPLETE|verdict|pm|tick
PASS: every parsed decision joins to its producing attempt and run
